# Representative MD Structures

This directory contains representative protein–substrate structures from the equilibrated MD trajectories of GG1-S, GG1-R, GG2-S, GG2-R, GGM-S, and GGM-R.

For each system, the representative structure of the most populated cluster was selected.
Structures are provided in PDB format and can be opened with molecular visualization software such as PyMOL.
